#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/properties/edit_element_name.rst:5
msgid "Define element name"
msgstr "定义元素名称"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/properties/edit_element_name.rst:7
msgid ""
"The element name is used to identify the `element`_ at QElectroTech. The "
"name has no relation with the element file name, they can be completely "
"different. The name file is the name from the file which contains the "
"information from the `element`_. The element name is the name which "
"represents the `element`_ in the different collection."
msgstr ""
"元素名称用于识别 QElectroTech 的 `元件 <element_>`_ 。 名称与元素文件名称没有关系，它们可以完全不同。 "
"名称文件是文件名称，其中包含来自 `元件 <element_>`_ 的信息。 元素名称是不同集合中代表 `元件 <element_>`_ 的名称 。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/properties/edit_element_name.rst:12
msgid ""
"The element name can be defined in many different languages. Depending on "
"the chosen language at QElectroTech settings, the name is displayed for the "
"user at one language or at another."
msgstr "元素名称可以用许多不同的语言定义。根据在 QElectroTech 设置中选择的语言，该名称以一种或另一种语言显示给用户。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/properties/edit_element_name.rst:18
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech element name PopUp window"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 元素名称 PopUp 窗口"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/properties/edit_element_name.rst:22
msgid ""
"QElectroTech works according `ISO 639-1`_ norm. The text language is defined"
" using 2 letters code which should be used at the **Language** column from "
"the cell value table."
msgstr ""
"QElectroTech 工作符合 `ISO 639-1 <ISO 639-1_>`_ 规范。文本语言的定义使用2个字母代码，应在单元格值表的 "
"**语言** 栏中使用。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/properties/edit_element_name.rst:28
msgid "Define element name from menu bar"
msgstr "从菜单栏定义元素名称"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/properties/edit_element_name.rst:30
msgid ""
"Select **Edit > Edit name and information of the element** menu item to "
"display the name editor PopUp window."
msgstr "选择 **Edit > 编辑元素的名称和信息** 菜单项以显示名称编辑器 PopUp 窗口 。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/properties/edit_element_name.rst:35
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech element editor Edit Menu"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech 元素编辑器编辑菜单"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/properties/edit_element_name.rst:37
#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/properties/edit_element_name.rst:47
#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/properties/edit_element_name.rst:64
msgid ""
"Press the button **+ Add a line** to introduce a new row at the element name"
" table."
msgstr "按下按钮 **+ 添加一行** 在元素名称表中引入新行。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/properties/edit_element_name.rst:38
#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/properties/edit_element_name.rst:48
#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/properties/edit_element_name.rst:65
msgid "Define the 2 letters code language at **Language** column."
msgstr "在 **Language** 栏中定义2个字母代码语言。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/properties/edit_element_name.rst:39
#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/properties/edit_element_name.rst:49
#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/properties/edit_element_name.rst:66
msgid "Define the element name with the defined language at **Text** column."
msgstr "在 **Text** 栏用定义的语言定义元素名称。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/properties/edit_element_name.rst:40
#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/properties/edit_element_name.rst:50
#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/properties/edit_element_name.rst:67
msgid ""
"Press the button **OK** to accept and close the name editor PopUp window."
msgstr "按下按钮 **OK** 接受并关闭名称编辑器 PopUp 窗口。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/properties/edit_element_name.rst:44
msgid "Define element name from toolbar"
msgstr "从工具栏中定义元素名称"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/properties/edit_element_name.rst:46
msgid ""
"Press the icon |names| from the `toolbar`_ to display the name editor PopUp "
"window."
msgstr "按下图标 |names| 从 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ 以显示名称编辑器 PopUp 窗口。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/properties/edit_element_name.rst:52
msgid "names"
msgstr "名称"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/properties/edit_element_name.rst:56
msgid ""
"If the `toolbar`_ is not displayed, it can be displayed from **Settings > "
"Display > Element**."
msgstr "如果 `工具栏 <toolbar_>`_ 未显示，可以从 **设置 > 显示 > 元素** 显示。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/properties/edit_element_name.rst:59
msgid "Define element name using keyboard shortcut"
msgstr "使用键盘快捷键定义元素名称"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/properties/edit_element_name.rst:61
msgid ""
"QElectroTech allows using keyboard shortcut to increase the working "
"efficiency."
msgstr "QElectroTech允许使用键盘快捷键来提高工作效率。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/properties/edit_element_name.rst:63
msgid "Press ``Ctrl + e`` to display the name editor PopUp window."
msgstr "按 ``Ctrl + e`` 显示名称编辑器 PopUp 窗口 。"

#: ../../source/users/element/element_editor/edition/properties/edit_element_name.rst:71
msgid ""
"For more information about QElectroTech keyboard shortcut, refer to `menu "
"bar`_ section."
msgstr "关于QElectroTech键盘快捷键的更多信息，请参见 `菜单栏 <menu bar_>`_ 一节。"
